1977		\]
1978		The extended-line measurement at $\ell$ is the conditional average, under
1979		$D_{\mid\ell}$, of the concrete paired-line measurements postprocessed by
1980		$(f_X,f_Z)\mapsto h$. The positive fiber mass makes $D_{\mid\ell}$ a
1981		probability distribution, and finite disintegration gives
