+nonnegative sandwich weights before using completeness. The exception
+$\beta=0$ contributes at most another $\|v\|^2/|F|$ by contraction.
+Apply the squared triangle inequality to
+$(I-X_r)v=(I-X_r)(v-Tv)+(I-X_r)Tv$.
